abstract: >
  This repository accompanies the research project *“Generalizable Ensemble Deep Learning for Skin Lesion Classification: Internal and External Validation on HAM10000 and ISIC 2019”*. 
  It implements a reproducible deep learning pipeline combining ResNet, EfficientNet, DenseNet, and ConvNeXt architectures, with ensemble averaging for robust multi-class skin lesion diagnosis.
  The work emphasizes performance generalization, model interpretability, and standardized evaluation across internal (HAM10000) and external (ISIC 2019) datasets.

